# Directive Status History

Append-only. Reviewer-owned. Every directive ever tracked in
`.friday/active/harness/status.md` ends up here exactly once, in the same
close-out pass that sets it `closed`, closes its tracker issue (if any), and
moves `.friday/active/harness/plans/directives/<ID>.md` to
`plans/directives/closed/` (rule 3 / rule 13). This is the summary record
that survives even if the local directive files are lost —
